 Archive. Item: The Sushrutasaṃhitā of Sushruta with the Nibandhasangraha Commentary of Shree Dalhaṇāchārya. 2 ed. · Acharya, Jadavji Trikamji · 1931, 828 scanned pages. Published 1931; edited by Jādavji Trikamji Āchārya (died 1946); public domain in India.</p><p>This book is not stored in this library: its pages are shown from the Internet Archive when they are opened, in this library's own viewer, and each chapter ends with this credit. The pages are shown as scans in this library's viewer (zoom, pan, thumbnails); the text of this book is in a script the machine reading of the scans cannot yet give. The item on the Internet Archive (opened only if you click it).</p>"},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-1-25.html","title":"Pages 1–25","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-101-125.html","title":"Pages 101–125","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-126-150.html","title":"Pages 126–150","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-151-175.html","title":"Pages 151–175","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-176-200.html","title":"Pages 176–200","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-201-225.html","title":"Pages 201–225","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-226-250.html","title":"Pages 226–250","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-251-275.html","title":"Pages 251–275","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-26-50.html","title":"Pages 26–50","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-276-300.html","title":"Pages 276–300","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-301-325.html","title":"Pages 301–325","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-326-350.html","title":"Pages 326–350","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/sushruta-samhita-jadavji/pages-351-375.html","title":"Pages